'''Gloria Bashige Nehema''' (born on 25 December 2002), known professionally as '''Gloria Bash''', is a Congolese singer-songwriter from [[Bukavu]] who rose to prominence through [[social media]] in 2022 after posting online [[Cover version|covers]], [[Medley (music)|medleys]], and [[Mashup (music)|mashups]] of songs by established artists.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Mukaya |first=Mookie |date=29 December 2024 |title=Gros plan sur Gloria Bash, l'étoile montante de la musique congolaise: en route vers le sommet |url=https://congoprofond.net/gros-plan-sur-gloria-bash-letoile-montante-de-la-musique-congolaise-en-route-vers-le-sommet/ |access-date=31 December 2024 |language=fr-FR|website=Congoprofond.net|trans-title=A close look at Gloria Bash, the rising star of Congolese music: on the road to the top}}</ref><ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Du talent à la voix, elle sadapte, perce et surprend...zoom sur Gloria Bash, lartiste révélée trop tôt |url=https://www.243stars.com/article-7269.html |access-date=31 December 2024 |website=243Stars |language=fr|date=22 June 2022|last=Johnson|first=Verite|trans-title=From her vocal talent, she adapts, breaks through, and surprises... a closer look at Gloria Bash, the artist revealed too soon}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Kasi |date=27 June 2023 |title=Découverte : Gloria Bash, un talent brut à polir! |url=https://arts.cd/decouverte-gloria-bash-un-talent-brut-a-polir/ |access-date=31 December 2024 |website=Arts.cd |language=fr-FR|first=David|trans-title=Discovery: Gloria Bash, a raw talent waiting to be polished!}}</ref> Often referred to as "'''Gogo'''",<ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC">{{Cite web |last=Kasereka |date=18 July 2024 |title=RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC |url=https://gueules-afrique.com/rdc-a-20-ans-la-jeune-artiste-gloria-bash-est-lartiste-urbaine-feminine-la-plus-suivie-sur-youtube-en-rdc/ |access-date=31 December 2024 |website=Gueules Afrique |language=fr-FR|first=Chris|trans-title=DRC: At 20 years old, the young artist Gloria Bash is the most followed female urban artist on YouTube in the DRC}}</ref> she mainly performs in [[Swahili]], [[French language|French]], and [[Lingala]].<ref name=":2">{{Cite web |last=Masamba |first=Plamedi |date=7 April 2025 |title=Gloria Bash: "Les gens ne réalisent pas que la RDC n'a pas que le Lingala" |trans-title=Gloria Bash: "People don't realize that the DRC has more than just Lingala" |url=https://www.eventsrdc.com/gloria-bash-les-gens-ne-realisent-pas-que-la-rdc-na-pas-que-le-lingala/ |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=Eventsrdc.com |language=fr-FR}}</ref>

Raised in [[Goma]], she gained widespread recognition for her medley reinterpretation of [[Fally Ipupa]]'s album ''Tokooos II'',<ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" /> which earned her the nickname "the female Fally Ipupa" among fans in the Democratic Republic of the Congo.<ref name=":3">{{Cite web |last=Mandina |first=Hervé |date=22 June 2023 |title=Afro-Club, le hit des platines avec Omah Lay, Mathey, Sidiki et Ahmed Diabaté |trans-title=Afro-Club, the hit on the turntables with Omah Lay, Mathey, Sidiki and Ahmed Diabaté |url=https://musique.rfi.fr/musique-africaine/20230622-afro-club-le-hit-platines-omah-lay-mathey-sidiki-ahmed-diabate |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=Musique.rfi.fr |publisher=[[Radio France Internationale]] |language=fr |publication-place=Paris, France}}</ref> She later competed in Season 8 of ''Vodacom Best of the Best All Stars'', the Congolese version of the international ''[[Idol (franchise)|Idol]]'' franchise.<ref name=":4">{{Cite web |last=Matanda |first=Alvin |date=19 September 2022 |title=Vodacom Best of the Best 2022: Jacob Jay est l'heureux gagnant du concours |trans-title=Vodacom Best of the Best 2022: Jacob Jay is the lucky winner of the competition |url=https://www.musicinafrica.net/fr/magazine/vodacom-best-best-2022-jacob-jay-est-lheureux-gagnant-du-concours |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=Music In Africa |language=fr}}</ref> Following the competition, she released several singles before issuing her debut [[Extended play|Extended Play]] (EP) ''Patrona'' in 2025, followed by her second EP, ''Zoshi'', in 2026.<ref name=":2" /><ref name=":5">{{Cite web |last=Migabo |first=Franklin |date=6 May 2026 |title=Foncez voir ça!: Gims partage "Fiesta" de Gloria Bash et intrigue sur le contenu de son EP "Zoshi" |trans-title=Go check it out!: Gims shares Gloria Bash's "Fiesta" and teases about the content of his EP "Zoshi" |url=https://kulturalmag.cd/wanny-s-king-et-innossb-attendus-le-12-avril-2026-pour-la-cloture-de-la-11%E1%B5%89-edition-du-festival-amani/?rf_page=article&slug=foncez-voir-a-gims-partage-fiesta-de-gloria-bash-et-intrigue-sur-le-contenu-de-son-ep-zoshi |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=KulturalMag |language=fr}}</ref><ref name=":6">{{Cite web |last=Kitatu |first=Jonathan |date=29 April 2026 |title=EP "Zoshi": Gloria Bash annonce une collaboration unique avec The Mingongo |trans-title=EP "Zoshi": Gloria Bash announces a unique collaboration with The Mingongo |url=https://kulturalmag.cd/wanny-s-king-et-innossb-attendus-le-12-avril-2026-pour-la-cloture-de-la-11%E1%B5%89-edition-du-festival-amani/?rf_page=article&slug=ep-zoshi-gloria-bash-annonce-une-collaboration-unique-avec-the-mingongo |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=KulturalMag |language=fr}}</ref>

== Life and career ==
=== 2002–2023: Childhood, career beginnings and education ===
Gloria Bash was born Gloria Bashige Nehema on 25 December 2002 in [[Bukavu]], located in the province of [[South Kivu]] in eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo.<ref name=":0" /><ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" /><ref>{{Cite web |date=4 June 2022 |title=Une jeune catholique de Goma sort une chanson pour accueillir le Pape |url=https://www.vaticannews.va/fr/afrique/news/2022-06/une-jeune-catholique-de-goma-sort-une-chanson-pour-accueillir-le.html |access-date=31 December 2024 |website=Vatican News |language=fr|last=Kambashi|first=Stanislas|trans-title=A young Catholic woman from Goma releases a song to welcome the Pope.}}</ref> She is the youngest of six children born to Pontient Bashigi and Pelagi Bujiriri.<ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" /> Raised in [[Goma]] in [[North Kivu]], she started singing at the age of 10 in the children's Redemptoris Mater [[choir]] of the Bienheureuse Anuarite [[Parish (Catholic Church)|parish]] at the [[Catholic Church]].<ref name=":0" /><ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" /><ref name=":7">{{Cite web |last= |first= |date=21 February 2022 |title=Musique: Gloria Bashige, la jeune pépite de Goma à la voix cristalline |trans-title=Music: Gloria Bashige, the young star from Goma with the crystal-clear voice |url=https://www.eventsrdc.com/musique-gloria-bashige-la-jeune-pepite-de-goma-a-la-voix-cristalline/ |access-date=10 May 2026 |website=Eventsrdc.com |language=fr-FR}}</ref> At 16, she stepped away from the choir to pursue modeling. A year later, she joined the [[Foyer Culturel de Goma]], where she trained in [[poetry]], slam, [[public speaking]], writing, and [[critical thinking]].<ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" /> Bash had also been active in theater since the age of 12, and she later described her time at the Foyer Culturel de Goma as an important foundation in her development.<ref name="RDC: À 20 ans, la jeune artiste Gloria Bash est l'artiste urbaine féminine la plus suivie sur YOUTUBE en RDC" />

